typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_IRN_IronThrone_ExperimentsNote01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_IRN_IronThrone_ExperimentsNote01\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">92bd2cd8-ef64-4c09-983e-1b6a61045f5b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:92bd2cd8-ef64-4c09-983e-1b6a61045f5b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:92bd2cd8-ef64-4c09-983e-1b6a61045f5b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the south-east of the <a href=\"/wiki/Iron_Throne\" title=\"Iron Throne\">Iron Throne</a>, inside a crate at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;27&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;57</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>How far might one individual go to save another? Where is the threshold of sacrifice? We separated twelve offspring of various species from their parents and established them in adjacent cells. The offspring were subjected to steadily increasing levels of physical and psychological torment. The parents were told that by pulling a lever, the torment would cease, but would result in their own deaths. All twelve pulled the lever, with test case five lasting the longest - he died around midday.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit re